{"unit_id":"dsh-plugin-collection__dsh-herdr-site#card-zh","repo":"dsh-plugin-collection/dsh-herdr-site","commit":"b5a5d927413ab42da749a5fc0aa01ecc1163fbbd","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-herdr-site 将 DSH TUI 的 agent 状态同步到 Herdr pane。插件监听 Cordis 生命周期事件，把运行中、空闲分别报告为 working 和 idle，并在 ask_user_question 等待人工回答时报告 blocked；收到结果后恢复 working。状态重复时会跳过报告，序号递增；卸载时释放 agent 状态。可选 blockMessage 用于附加等待说明。适合希望在 Herdr 管理 DSH 终端 pane、查看 agent 状态并使用跳转或等待能力的用户。需在 Herdr pane 中运行并提供 pane ID，无需 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:140-202","cordis.patch.yml:10-15"]}
